  "question": {
    "text": "The number of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;digit numbers, that are divisible by either <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math> but not divisible by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>48</mn></math> , is"
  },
